# Vauxhall Astra Mk6 (Astra J) five-door hatchback, 2009-2015.
#
# 4,419 mm long, 1,814 mm wide, 1,510 mm high, 2,685 mm wheelbase; 1.4-2.0
# petrol and diesels. The Opel Astra J is the same car.
# https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Opel_Astra#Astra_J_(2009%E2%80%932015)
#
# Colours: Black Sapphire, Star Silver, Flame Red and Metro Blue are period
# Vauxhall colours.
#
# Weight: 260 in total (silver 85, black 70, red 55, blue 50).
#
# Speed 200 km/h; comfort 120/510 (line). Classes 0,1.
# Dates: 2009-2015 with a road tail to about 2023.
#
# Metres master: citycars/4.5/vauxhall-astra-mk6.blend. References:
# citycars/references/vauxhall-astra-mk6/ (gitignored). Images via Wikimedia
# Commons.

